flowchart TD
    A[RegOpenKeyEx: open Run_ID key] --> B[RegEnumValue: collect all value names]
    B --> C{Next value?}
    C -- no --> Z[Print statistics, RegCloseKey]
    C -- yes --> D[RegQueryValueEx: read REG_SZ data]
    D --> E{Read and parse OK?}
    E -- no --> F[Log, keep the value]
    F --> C
    E -- yes --> G{expiresUtc <= now?}
    G -- no --> H[Keep valid record]
    H --> C
    G -- yes --> I[RegDeleteValue: delete record]
    I --> C
